            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changed

- Debrid sources only play when they're already cached. NuviOS no longer
  opens, tests or falls back to a source that isn't cached — or a debrid source
  that doesn't say — so it never starts a download on your Torbox or
  Real-Debrid account. Picking one explains why and asks for a source marked
  ⚡ or +.
]]></description>
